maxLik: Maximum Likelihood Estimation and Related Tools

Functions for Maximum Likelihood (ML) estimation, non-linear optimization,
and related tools. It includes a unified way to call different optimizers,
and classes and methods to handle the results from the Maximum Likelihood
viewpoint. It also includes a number of convenience tools for testing and
developing your own models.


